{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "479be015b678c1634cd4c7cb7b4aac9ac288ae0c9a7258ac0b81463b6fc5f21c", "ja": "撮影会でファンサに励むまつりをねぎらう\nプロデューサー。まつりは、これは自分の\nわがままだと返す。撮影会は誰もが笑顔に\nなれる魔法の時間、暗い顔のまま帰さない、\nお姫さまの譲れないわがままなのだと。", "zh": "慰劳在摄影会上努力为粉丝服务的茉莉的制作人。茉莉回应说，这是自己的任性。摄影会是能让所有人露出笑容的魔法时光，不能让大家愁眉苦脸地回去，这是公主绝不退让的任性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c6f5f362020a723e05d7570c2e891381f7fc8b92aa3a2cbab277ab7516f16920", "ja": "撮影会当日……", "zh": "拍摄会当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1001_kamerasukinofuxan", "source_sha256": "6559832814b3ea20b3ab7cab13ccbcc84e46e6d10236bb34754bf184d5788e2f", "ja": "あのっ！\nまつりちゃん、こっちに視線ください！", "zh": "那个！\n茉莉，请看这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "337143ff4e29c6c7bf4fe94a5790425fe06b5134bc3299fca006eada34aafcad", "ja": "はいなのです！　準備はいいのです？\n３、２、１、ほっ！", "zh": "好的哦！准备好了吗？\n３、２、１，嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1003_null", "source_sha256": "ec454f2df85512c6b256bd77e40478efb7499dfeea19f2452596b4ee8e6c0af6", "ja": "パシャパシャ！！", "zh": "咔嚓咔嚓！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1004_aitakattafuxan", "source_sha256": "53469b1c7c09e74edae5106074cab45dde20db8830992fbc7670ab681bcf4e65", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n会えてうれしいです！", "zh": "非常感谢！\n能见到你真开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "c6a9a2b0f20d70ad9021740c28c9905a893b0f8773fa29022add66a454fadef1", "ja": "姫もうれしいのです。\n今日は心ゆくまで楽しんでほしいのです♪", "zh": "公主也很高兴哦。\n希望你今天能尽情享受呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "c8660b1b458f9833fd34acdd456264267e9057236e5bcab98ac340c5a6482b74", "ja": "おや？　ティーカップが空なのです。\nおかわりはいかがですか？", "zh": "咦？茶杯空了呢。\n要再来一杯吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1007_koutyasukinofuxan", "source_sha256": "eb5ba9159829b6f05bdf1caad0d451eaa2932feae3791ed5b686716065018c94", "ja": "お願いします！\nああっ、姫に紅茶を注いでもらえるなんて……！", "zh": "拜托了！  \n啊啊，居然能让公主为我倒红茶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "d96d927f6c7145a2025891a658bdf3eaf6fc5a010a025c1b1d55015b30e4e8f4", "ja": "（みんな、ファンと積極的にコミュニケーションを\n取って、イベントを盛り上げてくれているな）", "zh": "（大家都在积极地和粉丝交流，让活动气氛热闹起来啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "a88ac8c76b9004f81d00a1ea467872183d255026e5abe1ff37dc2c18dab06347", "ja": "みなさん、もうすぐ入れ替えの時間なのですよ♪\n姫たちの写真、バッチリ撮れたのです？　……ほ？", "zh": "各位，马上就到轮换时间了哦♪\n有把公主们的照片拍得美美的吗？……哎？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1010_fuxannoonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "4740071422c01200ed3a0071749abd94f9469ebed6b74ad5f2fe34eb0e6d77e8", "ja": "あ、あの、えっと……、うう。\n……き、今日はありがとうございました……っ。", "zh": "啊、那个，呃……呜。\n……今、今天真的谢谢您……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "8a7a050e3bd2941e52e8f6c44e592b16b5962b73afdead2e7955e1e1e93861af", "ja": "あなたのコーデ、\nネイルもインナーカラーも姫の色、緑色なのですね♪", "zh": "你的这身搭配，\n指甲和内层挑染都是公主的颜色，是绿色呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1013_maturifuxannoonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "c11f63561b7d041d2fa046465f2631fe23146f5d4a686b119e3d5b3772f7417f", "ja": "！！　き、気付いてくれた……！　あのこれ、\nまつり姫に会うから考えたコーデで……その……！", "zh": "！！你、你注意到了……！那个，因为要去见祭典公主，所以我特意想了这身搭配……那个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "58cbb92a256ecfdcee3fd5d783d6137839143ad76425426bae9cd500aa6bd759", "ja": "とっても素敵なまつり姫コーデなのです。\n姫と並んで一緒に写真を撮りましょー！なのです♪", "zh": "真是特别棒的茉莉公主风搭配呢。和公主并肩一起拍照吧——！♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1015_maturifuxannoonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "411dc0dc5cfc3ffc72b0c854b51790b9650ce6cd9a08c5c4b61782e92add2d1a", "ja": "えっ、いいの……！？\nは、はいっ、ぜひお願いします！", "zh": "诶，可以吗……！？\n好、好的！那就拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "72f88b22b9133b7fba685592bdc71e17a03a2ccfa8b6538362274bd91daf812a", "ja": "準備はいいのです？\n３、２、１、ほっ！", "zh": "准备好了吗？\n３、２、１，嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1017_null", "source_sha256": "5a1556799a8fbb6e9f22abae385bab577418136dde255f42ae2c2b1a4f72f6cb", "ja": "パシャ！", "zh": "咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1018_staff", "source_sha256": "f2c7c96079dfb76858c39dc6893b0527597e8899157049b880c3a66f07e8cd16", "ja": "撮影のお時間終了でーす！\n入れ替え制となっておりますので、ご協力くださーい！", "zh": "拍摄时间结束啦！\n本次采用轮换制，请大家配合啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1019_maturifuxannoonnnanoko", "source_sha256": "7a1462fe66c38bfa4d6d2f3e3fd301865237455c9cec7175e53a3d80cd5517fb", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます！　あのっ、私、手紙……\nファンレター、絶対に書きます！！", "zh": "啊，非常感谢您！那个，我……信……\n我一定会写粉丝来信的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "2dc1e6f27e6027307e2f6058d68684ee3de9eabfe5593393d9799361c82dd9cd", "ja": "楽しみなのです。でも、もうすぐできる姫たちのお城、\n劇場にも遊び来てほしいのですよ？　……約束、ね♪", "zh": "我很期待哦。不过，也请一定来剧场看看姬和大家马上就要建成的城堡哦？……说好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1021_null", "source_sha256": "5c9af4b5b2aa1ace549901b1dd08841e93149adc7b423b2188c1b9a871869642", "ja": "入れ替えによる休憩中……", "zh": "正在因替换而休息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "b375a33082e6a33f2c196df615372f4502bcbccaf5c382f4d5d6fd6814c28968", "ja": "お疲れさま、まつり。\nティーパーティーは順調みたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，小茉莉。\n茶会好像进行得很顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "6ab1dc54a8ea83289520edd4106fb763399d70cdfc7f11e7e1d361f54fb6699a", "ja": "バッチリなのです！　びゅりほー！なお庭のおかげで、\n大盛り上がりなのですよ♪", "zh": "一切都很顺利哦！庭院漂亮极了，多亏了它，现场热闹极了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "8d2fc9bfc10e2eb6c8419ce7a9a3c8493702bf31451144840b42bc90cb8e5f18", "ja": "庭のおかげもあるだろうけど、\nどっちかっていうと、まつりのおかげだと思う。", "zh": "虽说也有庭院的功劳，\n但硬要说的话，我觉得主要还是多亏了茉莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "b25577c75a6c930405155d1d64e778770784750704da1541977000c567c034b9", "ja": "ほ？", "zh": "哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "940142ff6780fb9ca48522173b5875ce2b4b74ae64d0912b235663694eb911ae", "ja": "さっきの子、すごく喜んでたよ。\nあの写真も宝物になるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "刚才那个孩子特别开心哦。\n那张照片也会成为宝物吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "dce706b7eb81d892bcccb361e7dd7d32e6259db02ef1c4c859883784487db9e6", "ja": "……姫は、特別なことはなにもしてないのです。\nただあの子を、わがままに巻き込んだだけなのですよ？", "zh": "……公主其实什么特别的事都没做哦。\n只不过是把那个孩子卷进了自己的任性里而已呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "7fc67d792dc5bec9f84af532a245c975010f1f2c5edb4793242f3fbb68a5004f", "ja": "？　わがまま？", "zh": "？任性？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "3319c371fa68d677ad99a7519485d1dd96325e25fd974d8c7337332958deb8a2", "ja": "だって今は、姫たちのティーパーティー。\nみんながキラキラの笑顔になれる、魔法の時間……。", "zh": "因为现在是公主们的茶话会。\n是能让大家露出闪闪发光笑容的魔法时光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "fc8c02be32e5deddf1a1fe3aa6a8234de2769107f4a55d64c0254eab7f73be67", "ja": "なので、暗い顔をするのは、めっ！なのですよ♪", "zh": "所以，不可以露出阴沉的表情，乖♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "50568e611cbe362af892adf1006e84bd9c6e52cac931767cd448c267e86dfb50", "ja": "……なるほど。\nそれが、お姫さまはわがままってことか。", "zh": "……原来如此。\n也就是说，公主很任性啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "2c42a46d2622fd233e4891fc1ae4d4f4c61b88456b2702bf32d16b489324f317", "ja": "なのです♪　姫はとってもわがままなので、今日も\n楽しかったけど……まだまだ、もの足りないのです。", "zh": "就是这样♪ 因为公主非常任性，所以今天虽然也很开心……\n但还是远远不够尽兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_05_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "67af86aa3f76e327ed18659980889f70e2ea47a77c43e3225c04d3b95093b1f2", "ja": "いつか、もっとキラキラした場所で……。\nもっとたくさんのみんなをキラキラさせたいのです！", "zh": "总有一天，要在更加闪闪发光的地方……\n让更多的人都变得闪闪发光呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
